cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this record, please cite it as below. The DOI covers every version; each release also has its own DOI on Zenodo."
type: dataset
title: "Aseryx research: held-out tests of the Aseryx readiness score"
abstract: >-
  The test record behind the Aseryx readiness score, a 0 to 100 rating of how
  clean and well-formed a table is. Held-out set 9: 160 public files registered
  before download, labelled from their publishers' own documentation, and scored
  once by every version of the score from v6 to v11. No version passed. The
  record gives every file's source, licence, SHA-256 and score per version,
  95% bootstrap intervals on every comparison, every exclusion and deviation,
  and a Groth16 zero-knowledge proof of every v11 score, checkable against a
  published verification key and a verifier contract on Avalanche Fuji. The
  scoring rules and engines are not published.
authors:
